commit 8a31249052f94a43854c097fc410602afe116006

C03: a foreign process exiting during the strong window inventory no longer aborts it (CLOSE1651)

CLOSE1649 measured «cierra whatsapp» with window.resolve ended inventory_failed: the strong inventory threw "The visible application inventory was incomplete." for any process whose reads raised during the enumeration, including a foreign process that had just exited (WhatsApp's background task server relaunches and ends between GetProcesses and Refresh). An exited process owns no visible window and is skipped; only a live process can leave the candidate's inventory incomplete (ProcessHasExited reads HasExited and keeps the strict path when the state is unreadable).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


